WEBVTT

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:17.130
Nusumareta kako wo

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:20.330
Sagashitsuzukete

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:23.420
Ore wa samayou

00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:27.130
Mishiranu machi wo

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:32.080
Honou no nioi shimitsuite

00:00:32.330 --> 00:00:33.880
Museru

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:37.630
Sayonara wa itta hazu da

00:00:37.630 --> 00:00:40.540
Wakareta hazu sa

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.790
Jigoku wo mireba

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:47.330
Kokoro ga kawaku

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:52.750
Tatakai wa akita no sa

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:57.540
Sadame to areba

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.790
Kokoro wo kimeru

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.960
Sottoshite oite kure

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:07.750
Ashita ni

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:15.250
Aa tsunagaru kyou gurai

00:01:50.380 --> 00:01:52.540
I wish we could just keep on walking...

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:57.040
I have a feeling something awful
is going to happen.

00:02:01.040 --> 00:02:02.250
Do you want me to leave you here?

00:02:02.250 --> 00:02:06.040
No, if we separate now,
I'll never see you again.

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:08.960
I'm not going to die.

00:02:11.420 --> 00:02:13.580
This is something I have to do.

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:16.210
Chirico!

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:28.380
Intersection

00:03:10.040 --> 00:03:10.880
Chirico!

00:04:28.170 --> 00:04:31.130
Chirico! You owe us big time for this!

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:56.540
Chirico! Are you all right?

00:04:56.830 --> 00:05:00.170
Yeah. He just burned into
my leg circuits, that's all.

00:05:04.580 --> 00:05:06.960
Have you seen Captain Kan Yu?

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:09.250
I killed him.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:10.420
You what?

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.920
Y-you killed him?

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:22.330
He did it to save me.

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:24.960
They were fighting and Kan Yu
fell into a mountain river.

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:27.040
And who's she?

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:29.830
The enemy girl from the helicopter.

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:41.330
She's a PS.

00:05:41.750 --> 00:05:44.630
You mean the guy in the blue AT
isn't the only one?

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:45.710
Yeah.

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:49.290
I see... So, your real objective all along...

00:05:49.750 --> 00:05:51.670
...was this girl.

00:05:51.670 --> 00:05:56.750
Still, even if it was an accident,
killin' Kan Yu's gonna cause trouble.

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:58.540
That's not our only problem.

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.710
The enemy base is just up ahead.

00:06:02.380 --> 00:06:04.500
Yeah. I'm planning to sneak in.

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:07.500
You have your own agenda, don't you?

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:09.830
Tell us!

00:06:10.790 --> 00:06:12.130
Spit it out!

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:15.080
Let's find someplace to talk.

00:06:21.170 --> 00:06:23.500
It was at the end of the Hundred Years War.

00:06:25.920 --> 00:06:28.670
Melkia was beginning a secret project.

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:31.170
The PS Project.

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:35.880
And they had gotten as far as creating
an experimental subject.

00:06:36.960 --> 00:06:39.920
This subject was code named "the Prototype."

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:46.790
And, without knowing it, I'd been forced into
an operation to steal it for a secret society.

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:49.630
That one action changed my entire life.

00:06:50.290 --> 00:06:53.540
And so you're tracking down this "Secret Society?"

00:06:55.880 --> 00:06:59.330
They must be supporting Kanjelman.

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:01.040
Some sort of deal in the shadows.

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:02.880
Yeah, probably.

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:07.380
Anyway, even if he was an ass,
you killed your commander!

00:07:08.710 --> 00:07:10.380
Are you taking me in?

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:12.790
I don't wanna do that.

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:14.790
But we can't just let you go.

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:16.670
What do we do, Potaria?

00:07:17.080 --> 00:07:18.710
I'm going to the base.

00:07:18.710 --> 00:07:21.040
All I've wanted was to kill Kanjelman.

00:07:22.880 --> 00:07:26.210
It looks like Chirico wants to see
who's behind the PSs.

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:30.330
You wanna finish the mission?

00:07:30.330 --> 00:07:33.580
Yeah. And we won't let you two stop us.

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:34.880
I believe you.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:37.500
Betcha Kanjelman's head'll
bring you a nice bounty!

00:07:37.500 --> 00:07:39.540
This isn't for money! It's for my dreams!

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:41.630
The prince was once my commander!

00:07:42.540 --> 00:07:43.540
Commander?

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:47.130
Yeah... Back when we served in
the Kummen Royal Guard.

00:07:47.130 --> 00:07:49.290
He was a good man who loved this country.

00:07:49.920 --> 00:07:53.000
We used to discuss our dreams
for Kummen's future.

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:09.630
What's wrong?

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:11.880
Your Highness, I wish to speak frankly.

00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:16.000
Our forces can't hold this large an area.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:20.580
It's clear that enemy AT unit is following
a route from Crescent Moon Lake.

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:21.380
And so?

00:08:21.380 --> 00:08:22.250
Highness...

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:25.630
We should recall our troops from our bases

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:30.080
and be ready to repel the
main enemy force with one blow.

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:33.500
Let everything be decided here?

00:08:33.500 --> 00:08:36.790
I understand how passionately
you love this country.

00:08:36.790 --> 00:08:38.330
I feel the same way.

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:44.500
Very well! Let us show them our power in the end!

00:08:45.130 --> 00:08:46.040
Yes, sir!

00:08:46.040 --> 00:08:49.000
Recall our troops from the perimeter bases!

00:08:58.380 --> 00:08:59.880
Forgive me.

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:03.170
Unless the storm blows, the sun won't shine.

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:06.500
I have become that storm,
the destroyer of the old ways.

00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:09.880
The storm that will blow away
the dust of what was.

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.500
Cleanse yourself.

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:24.330
Not just of the scars to your body.

00:09:25.080 --> 00:09:28.420
Let every corner of your soul be cleansed.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:33.000
You've returned in disgrace,
betrayed by an enemy you cared for.

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:36.500
So, Proto One ran off by herself?

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:37.500
Yes, sir.

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:39.330
I don't think so.

00:09:40.790 --> 00:09:42.670
I believe she's with Chirico.

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:44.540
They're escaping together?

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:47.540
Whatever the case, they both have to die!

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:04.170
If we capture that PS guy,
the Melkians'll probably pay us a bundle.

00:10:04.170 --> 00:10:06.420
He's practically money in the bank!

00:10:07.880 --> 00:10:09.630
What are you guys going to do?

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:15.210
I don't have anything better to do,
so I'm free to help you out.

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:17.880
Come on, move it!

00:10:21.750 --> 00:10:22.960
I'm staying behind.

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:24.040
What?

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:27.830
I'm just a mercenary who still has
a contract to fulfill.

00:10:27.830 --> 00:10:29.540
I'll wait for the main forces to arrive.

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:32.580
Do what you want. Damned teacher's pet!

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:45.790
It's one of ours.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:49.710
Is that the Prototype that Captain Kan Yu found?

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:54.330
Turn her over to us at once!
Those are General Gon Nu's orders!

00:10:56.880 --> 00:10:58.170
Chirico...

00:10:58.170 --> 00:10:59.580
Don't worry.

00:11:00.210 --> 00:11:02.580
Roger! Bring 'er down!

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:15.040
What are you doing?

00:11:20.790 --> 00:11:23.330
Guess I'm out of a job like the rest of you.

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:36.750
What?! Chirico and the others?!

00:11:36.750 --> 00:11:39.790
All right, I see. Keep them under observation.

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:43.080
Chirico, you traitor!

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:45.460
Did you kill Kan Yu, too?

00:11:53.920 --> 00:11:57.380
And how is everything proceeding, Gon Nu?

00:11:57.380 --> 00:12:00.540
Smoothly. We've located the Prototype.

00:12:00.830 --> 00:12:04.880
Oh, you've done it. This is your show now.

00:12:04.880 --> 00:12:06.540
We will not forgive any failures at this point.

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:08.000
Understood, sir.

00:12:08.000 --> 00:12:10.500
We're scrambling all our forces to recover it.

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.500
I will, of course, be leading the operation.

00:12:12.500 --> 00:12:16.210
Just have the PS in hand
before the main push begins.

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:19.000
We don't want her stolen from
the Kummen military as well!

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:21.710
Understood, sir. Leave this to me.

00:12:21.710 --> 00:12:23.290
May your campaign be successful.

00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:24.710
It will, sir.

00:12:25.040 --> 00:12:27.170
Dammit, Chirico! Where are you going?

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:32.000
They were hit near Crescent Moon Lake?

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:35.710
Yeah, and the task force
got scattered all over the place.

00:12:35.710 --> 00:12:38.880
Even Kan Yu disappeared in the confusion.

00:12:39.880 --> 00:12:41.880
I wonder if Chirico's all right?

00:12:41.880 --> 00:12:44.130
He wouldn't die even if you killed him.

00:12:44.630 --> 00:12:47.500
He's probably looking for the Phantom Lady-

00:12:48.710 --> 00:12:53.420
Sure he is! That's who he's after, right?

00:12:57.040 --> 00:13:00.790
Uh, anyway, the war's big finale
will be starting soon, right?

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:05.170
Yeah, this base'll be empty soon.
Better find some new jobs.

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:06.330
This is command.

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:09.080
Airman second class Vanilla Vartla.
Please report for takeoff.

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:10.920
Repeat, this is command.

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:13.380
Airman second class Vanilla Vartla,
report for takeoff.

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:15.210
Well folks, that's my cue.

00:13:15.210 --> 00:13:17.750
Be careful. The main mission is
always to come back alive.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:19.250
Right. Oh, Coconna.

00:13:19.250 --> 00:13:22.420
If I run into Chirico, I'll say "hi" for you.

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:23.330
Later!

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:28.080
Vanilla!

00:13:31.500 --> 00:13:33.380
Come back in one piece, okay?

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:38.170
Come on, don't be like that.

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.710
Stay faithful.

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:46.420
Even if that isn't your style. See you!

00:14:14.830 --> 00:14:17.250
Chirico, there are enemies nearby.

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:31.790
Maybe she's imagining it.

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:33.630
A PS's senses are extremely sharp.

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:44.750
Below the waterfall!

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:23.580
God damned water trolls!

00:15:28.210 --> 00:15:29.630
Chirico, to the right!

00:15:32.920 --> 00:15:34.290
Below the rocks to the left!

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:42.630
Below the rock face! Three of them!

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:52.710
Great job! You PSs kick ass!

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:08.880
We're near their base.

00:16:08.880 --> 00:16:10.420
These attacks are going to get worse.

00:16:10.420 --> 00:16:13.080
I'm ready for them. Let 'em come!

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:24.580
Well, ain't that sweet?

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:31.420
The consequences of this are clear!

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:34.000
The defective unit should have been destroyed!

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:38.630
Ypsilon, you must become a fully-functional PS.

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:41.460
You must think of nothing outside of battle.

00:16:42.080 --> 00:16:46.460
Borough! I have doubts about
your competence at managing this.

00:16:46.460 --> 00:16:48.960
Yes, sir. I realize that.

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:51.670
We must look beyond the
Holy Kingdom of Kummen now.

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:54.170
Kanjelman seems to be
up to something on his own.

00:16:54.170 --> 00:16:58.460
All I want is to know
the full extent of a PS's power.

00:16:58.460 --> 00:17:01.290
To perfect every aspect of their abilities.

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:07.790
The Society has completed a new PS-use AT.

00:17:11.290 --> 00:17:15.920
It links the PS's thoughts
directly with the AT's controls.

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:18.750
It will be unbeatable in battle.

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:21.250
Ypsilon, I give it to you.

00:17:21.250 --> 00:17:22.170
Yes, sir.

00:17:22.170 --> 00:17:25.130
Borough, make sure you kill her and Chirico.

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:26.830
Failure will not be tolerated!

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:29.830
Yes, sir! This time for sure!

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:31.250
This time you'd better!

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:47.000
An old fortress.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:48.830
Smells like a trap.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:51.460
Fyana, are there any other ways to go?

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:53.880
It's a straight line to the palace this way.

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.080
I say we bust in and attack!

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:58.170
I'll go in and check it out.

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:02.380
All right, we'll cover you. Be careful.

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:04.830
I'm a PS, remember?

00:18:10.290 --> 00:18:12.880
She just looks like a regular girl to me.

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:02.880
What? Pull out?

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:05.170
I thought I called for more reinforcements!

00:19:05.420 --> 00:19:08.580
If we don't stop them here,
where do we stop them?

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:10.080
Let me speak to your commander!

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:13.420
Letting them lay siege to the palace is suicide!

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:16.130
What? His Majesty ordered it?

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:17.460
Understood.

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:20.750
What are they doing?

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:31.210
What are you doing?

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:32.330
What's wrong with you?

00:19:37.040 --> 00:19:38.830
Intruder in the base!

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:02.880
Shit!

00:20:10.130 --> 00:20:12.500
Defend this base with your life! Fire!

00:20:37.670 --> 00:20:38.960
Come on!

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:44.960
Shit!

00:20:44.960 --> 00:20:46.500
Stop it! It isn't an enemy.

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:47.500
What?

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:54.830
That's definitely not a regular girl!

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:05.080
It's a first-rate position.

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:07.580
Yeah, and that's what bothers me.

00:21:08.000 --> 00:21:11.170
It'd make a good beachhead
against the big offensive.

00:21:12.500 --> 00:21:14.460
I heard them on the radio.

00:21:14.460 --> 00:21:17.540
The prince is recalling all forces
from the frontline bases.

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:19.040
That's insane!

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:23.750
Unless they use guerilla warfare to divide our
forces and wear us down, they can't win!

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:26.750
Kanjelman's one of the best
royal military strategists.

00:21:26.750 --> 00:21:28.040
So why is he...?

00:21:28.630 --> 00:21:31.290
This war has a lot of mysteries in it.

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:36.750
I just don't understand what he's really after.

00:21:36.750 --> 00:21:39.080
What's to understand?

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:42.080
You just wanna kill him! Right?

00:21:55.670 --> 00:21:56.960
Vanilla...

00:21:56.960 --> 00:21:58.130
Chirico!

00:22:01.540 --> 00:22:04.830
This is Airman second class Vartla. Come in HQ.

00:22:04.830 --> 00:22:06.170
This is HQ. Go ahead.

00:22:06.540 --> 00:22:09.960
I've located the task force.
Chirico and the others are fine.

00:22:09.960 --> 00:22:11.630
Is the Prototype with them?

00:22:12.130 --> 00:22:14.000
I just see four ATs.

00:22:14.000 --> 00:22:16.710
All right. Keep Chirico and the others there.

00:22:16.710 --> 00:22:19.130
We'll send in a strike team to wipe them out.

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:20.460
Wipe them out?!

00:22:20.460 --> 00:22:22.830
Gon Nu's orders. Don't let them get away.

00:22:23.170 --> 00:22:24.500
You can't-

00:22:24.500 --> 00:22:25.580
Oh, crap!

00:22:39.380 --> 00:22:41.960
Gon Nu wasn't going to let me go.

00:22:42.210 --> 00:22:45.750
As the enemy closed in from both sides,
my excitement built.

00:22:46.540 --> 00:22:50.080
But in the palace beneath
the gathering storm clouds...

00:22:50.080 --> 00:22:52.460
a deep whirlpool of suspicion was also building.

00:22:54.290 --> 00:22:55.710
Next Episode

00:22:55.880 --> 00:23:00.830
Collapsing loyalty,
a love betrayed, broken bonds.

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:04.540
A cry followed by flowing blood.

00:23:05.080 --> 00:23:06.790
Why do people do it?

00:23:07.380 --> 00:23:11.500
Why do they hold back their ideals and love
while hiding their tears?

00:23:11.830 --> 00:23:17.080
Only strength can force open
an unseen future from a bloodstained past.

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:19.750
Next time, "Infiltration"

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:23.130
Chirico is the broken needle
that stabs at the heart.

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:24.290
Intersection

00:23:19.920 --> 00:23:24.290
Next Time

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:46.000
Samishii toki mo

00:23:46.000 --> 00:23:49.540
Kanashii toki mo

00:23:49.540 --> 00:23:55.920
Itsumo anata ga me ni ukabu

00:23:56.420 --> 00:23:59.960
Hitori no toki mo

00:23:59.960 --> 00:24:03.380
Aitai toki mo

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:09.630
Itsumo anata wa mune no naka

00:24:09.630 --> 00:24:13.130
Tooku hanarete itemo

00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:16.540
Tatoe wakarete itemo

00:24:16.710 --> 00:24:23.040
Kono yo no hikari to tomo ni mabushiku

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:29.380
Ano hi no anata ga...
